  "description": "Replaces Umbraco's default boot-time database availability check, which gives up after five attempts over four seconds. This package keeps retrying until the database answers, or until a timeout you configure in appsettings.json is reached. By default it never times out, so a site whose database is slow to start - an Azure SQL serverless database resuming, or a container that outpaced its database - boots successfully instead of failing with a BootFailedException.",
